te query package.", "caption": "Retained is not eligible, eligible is not biography-covered, and current-term coverage is not prior-term coverage. Candidate-specific denominators and cast-vote dates are included in the complete query package.", "data": "plot-data/voting-record-coverage.csv", "files": {"marginoferror": {"background": "#F2EFE7", "height": 1560, "png": "marginoferror/voting-record-coverage.png", "svg": "marginoferror/voting-record-coverage.svg", "width": 2560}, "substack": {"background": "#F7F5F0", "height": 1560, "png": "substack/voting-record-coverage.png", "svg": "substack/voting-record-coverage.svg", "width": 2560}}, "id": "voting-record-coverage", "plotted_records": 24, "title": "Voting records describe a selective slice of nominees"}, {"alt": "The presidential benchmark can change the answer. Every pair uses identical candidate-election IDs. Sign changes are benchmark sensitivity, not proof that either score causes stronger electoral performance. No unqualified district cells are filled across redistricting.", "caption": "Every pair uses identical candidate-election IDs. Sign changes are benchmark sensitivity, not proof that either score causes stronger electoral performance. No unqualified district cells are filled across redistricting.", "data": "plot-data/benchmark-sensitivity.csv", "files": {"marginoferror": {"background": "#F2EFE7", "height": 1560, "png": "marginoferror/benchmark-sensitivity.png", "svg": "marginoferror/benchmark-sensitivity.svg", "width": 2560}, "substack": {"background": "#F7F5F0", "height": 1560, "png": "substack/benchmark-sensitivity.png", "svg": "substack/benchmark-sensitivity.svg", "width": 2560}}, "id": "benchmark-sensitivity", "plotted_records": 8, "title": "The presidential benchmark can change the answer"}, {"alt": "Unknown identity is the largest evidence gap. Only 240 of 405 eligible House races have the required compatible resident-population controls. Identity fits and exact pair support are downloadable; small 